{"title":"1957 AHSME Problems/Problem 9","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1957_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/9/b89ea9d56f8a53a71d833b00c4ccf9a178000895.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x - y^{x - y}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"67\" height=\"16\" /> when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/f/2effc7979b1c93e59356b73253d75e2740b33105.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/d/9fd395e96b1e4558dd201a3db8f41306bcbab938.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = -2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"56\" height=\"15\" /> is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/1/321708588306acedecd11b9a4a546364d9580892.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ -18 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ -14\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 14\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 18\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 256$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"447\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1957_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Just plug in the numbers and follow the order of operations:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/c/7bc477c4477c1d9d6ffc422d3699699a271dc37b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2-(-2)^{2-(-2)}\\]\" width=\"111\" height=\"20\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/9/a29a056a3543cb5cbd7c5b658ca0257b3681028a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2-(-2)^4\\]\" width=\"74\" height=\"20\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/6/a46ef0e27270afb3e97b6a8634677eb6a4902c1b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2-16\\]\" width=\"48\" height=\"12\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/b/41b37abad4022ea031caf383932688afac1a7376.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\boxed{\\textbf{(B) }-14}\\]\" width=\"87\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1957_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1957_AHSME\" title=\"1957 AHSME\">1957 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1957_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1957 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1957_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1957 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1957\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1957_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1957 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1957_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1957 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?ti